    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん！\r\n甘奈、この写真をツイスタに載せたいなー！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "よし、じゃあデータを送っておくな\r\nツイスタに載せる時は感謝祭のタグをつけてくれ──",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_joy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……はい、送ったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0134",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "わ、送るの早いね！？\r\nプロデューサーさん……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_joy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……甘奈はきっとそれを選ぶと思って、\r\nもう用意してあったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっ！　ど、どうしてわかったの？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ほら、前に甘奈の家で見せてもらった\r\n小さい頃のお遊戯会の写真……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "偶然だろうけど、あれと同じ構図で、\r\n同じポーズの写真だから……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "気付いてくれたんだ！？\r\nそっか、プロデューサーさんにはお見通しかぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でもね、変わった部分もあるでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "この写真には千雪さんもいるの☆",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、３人の写真になったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それにね舞台袖の方をよーく見ると\r\nプロデューサーさんも……",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え！　ちょっと待て、それは載せたらまずい…………！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あっ、ううん！　違うの\r\n暗くて写ってないから大丈夫……なんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_trouble",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈だけはここにプロデューサーさんがいるって\r\n知ってるんだ……って",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……それはその通りだ\r\nずっと舞台袖から見てたからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、見守ってくれてたよね……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──あ、甘奈。ちょっとこっちに\r\nもう一度モニターを見てくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "なになにっ！？　……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっ、この甘奈……\r\n事務所に入ったばっかりの頃じゃない！？",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、懐かしいだろう？\r\n一番最初にライブした時の写真だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "写真残ってたんだねー……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "なんかでも……\r\nうーん、こうして見ると……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "今とあんまり変わらなくない？\r\n甘奈、成長してるのかなあ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　全然違うじゃないか\r\n表情とか、姿勢とか……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "なんとなく、この時の方がキラキラしてない？\r\n気のせいかな……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは甘奈の見る目が\r\n厳しくなった証拠じゃないかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "大丈夫、今はもっともっと魅力的だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……そう言われると……照れちゃうなー☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ん……あのね、プロデューサーさん",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020190"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "──甘奈は、甘奈のペースで、\r\nちょっとずつ変わっていこうと思う",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……それがいい。それでこそ甘奈だよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへへっ……☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020210"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもなあ……本当に変わる時は\r\n一瞬だったりするんだろうな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そ、そうなのかなっ……？\r\nでもプロデューサーさんが言うなら……そうかも",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "じゃあ\r\nその一瞬、見逃さないでね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。楽しみにしてるよ、甘奈の未来",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014002020240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈も！　プロデューサーさんのそばにいて……\r\n未来──楽しみにしてるからね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400202/1014002020240"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
]